{"id":99583357790839,"type":"album","name":"Gaucho","artist":"Steely Dan","year":1980,"weight":20,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/16984-gaucho.jpg","aoty":86,"aoty_user":82,"yt":"tEMnug2-VjM","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/steely-dan/gaucho","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/16984-steely-dan-gaucho.php"},"desc":"Gaucho is the seventh studio album by the American jazz rock band Steely Dan, released on November 21, 1980 by MCA Records. The sessions for Gaucho represent the band's typical penchant for studio perfectionism and obsessive recording technique. To record the album, the band used at least 42 different musicians, spent over a year in the studio, and far exceeded the original monetary advance given by the record label. During the two-year span in which the album was recorded, the band was plagued by a number of creative, personal and professional problems. MCA, Warner Bros. and Steely Dan had a ."},"artist_ref":{"id":167361086744098,"name":"Steely Dan","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Steely_Dan_-_Donald_Fagen_-_Luzern_2007.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":18872195504512,"type":"genre","name":"Pop Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":740,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":117363531556446,"type":"genre","name":"Jazz-Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":263,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":136113600818764,"type":"genre","name":"Yacht Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":215,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":251671925246370,"type":"genre","name":"Soft Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":418,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":254136942605146,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Yacht Rock","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":2,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":82958032046503,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Soft Rock","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":3